OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night,
OL,6,Fwith patchy cloud and clear spells
OL,7,Fthroughout. Mist and fog patches
OL,8,Fforming under clear skies in the early
OL,9,Fhours. Mild for the time of year with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FMist and fog patches
OL,13,Fsteadily clear through the morning,
OL,14,Fleaving a dry and sunny day for many.
OL,15,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine with
OL,16,Flight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
