OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry and
OL,6,Fsettled conditions to end the week,
OL,7,Fwith sunny spells through the weekend.
OL,8,FOvernight fog and mist forming, this
OL,9,Fperhaps lingering through the morning
OL,10,Fhours. Turning cloudier later Sunday.
